ath d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"resume-inline-text\">教育经历</span></h3><div class=\"resume-item\"><div class=\"resume-row\"><strong>某某大学</strong><span class=\"muted\">2022.09 - 2026.06</span></div><p class=\"muted\">本科 · 工商管理</p><p>主修市场研究、数据分析、产品管理课程，参与多项课程项目。</p></div></section></div><div class=\"resume-module-frame  \" data-preview-module=\"awards\" draggable=\"false\" title=\"拖动这个模块框可以和其他模块交换位置\"><section class=\"resume-section\"><h3><span class=\"resume-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"resume-inline-text\">奖项</span></h3><ul class=\"resume-list\"><li>校级奖学金</li><li>创新创业竞赛优秀奖</li><li>优秀学生干部</li></ul></section></div><div class=\"resume-module-frame  \" data-preview-module=\"personalSummary\" draggable=\"false\" title=\"拖动这个模块框可以和其他模块交换位置\"><section class=\"resume-section\"><h3><span class=\"resume-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"resume-inline-text\">个人评价</span></h3><p><span>校招产品方向，熟悉用户调研、需求分析与原型设计，能将模糊需求转化为清晰方案并协同推进。</span><span class=\"skill-list\" style=\"margin-top:10px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #dfe4d8;border-radius:999px;background:#f8faf5;font-size:12px\">学习能力强，能快速拆解业务问题并推进落地。</span><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #dfe4d8;border-radius:999px;background:#f8faf5;font-size:12px\">沟通表达清晰，善于跨团队收集反馈。</span></span></p></section></div><div class=\"resume-module-frame  \" data-preview-module=\"internships\" draggable=\"false\" title=\"拖动这个模块框可以和其他模块交换位置\"><section class=\"resume-section\"><h3><span class=\"resume-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-briefcase-business\"><path d=\"M12 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M22 13a18.15 18.15 0 0 1-20 0\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><span class=\"resume-inline-text\">实习经历</span></h3><div class=\"resume-item\"><div class=\"resume-row\"><strong>产品经理实习生</strong><span class=\"muted\">2025.06 - 2025.09</span></div><p class=\"muted\">互联网产品团队</p><p>负责竞品分析、需求文档和功能验收，协同设计、研发推动核心功能迭代上线。</p></div></section></div><div class=\"resume-module-frame  \" data-preview-module=\"projects\" draggable=\"false\" title=\"拖动这个模块框可以和其他模块交换位置\"><section class=\"resume-section\"><h3><span class=\"resume-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"resume-inline-text\">项目经历</span></h3><div class=\"resume-item\"><div class=\"resume-row\"><strong>校园求职工具项目</strong><span class=\"muted\">2025.03 - 2025.06</span></div><p class=\"muted\">课程项目</p><p>负责用户访谈、需求拆解和流程设计，整理 120+ 份反馈并优化核心页面转化。</p></div></section></div><div class=\"resume-module-frame  \" data-preview-module=\"campusExperience\" draggable=\"false\" title=\"拖动这个模块框可以和其他模块交换位置\"><section class=\"resume-section\"><h3><span class=\"resume-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"resume-inline-text\">校园经历</span></h3><div class=\"resume-item\"><div class=\"resume-row\"><strong>学生会项目负责人</strong><span class=\"muted\">2023.09 - 2024.06</span></div><p class=\"muted\">校学生会</p><p>组织校级活动与跨部门协作，统筹排期、物料、宣传和现场执行。</p></div></section></div><div class=\"resume-module-frame  \" data-preview-module=\"skills\" draggable=\"false\" title=\"拖动这个模块框可以和其他模块交换位置\"><section class=\"resume-section\"><h3><span class=\"resume-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"resume-inline-text\">技能</span></h3><div class=\"skill-list\"><span>Axure</span><span>Figma</span><span>Excel</span><span>SQL</span><span>用户研究</span><span>竞品分析</span><span>PRD</span></div></section></div></article></div></div></div><div class=\"intro-floating-card is-score\"><strong>92</strong><span>ATS 匹配分</span></div><div class=\"intro-floating-card is-ai\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><span>AI 润色完成</span></div></div></div><div class=\"intro-feature-grid reveal-on-scroll\"><article><span>01</span><h2>先选模板，再进入编辑。</h2><p>像大厂官网一样用图判断风格，避免只看名字选择模板。</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>AI 帮你把经历写具体。</h2><p>把普通经历改成成果导向表达，补齐关键词和岗位匹配建议。</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>本地保存，低门槛开放。</h2><p>第一版不强制登录，草稿自动保存在浏览器，随时导出 JSON 备份。</p></article></div><section class=\"intro-section reveal-on-scroll\"><div class=\"intro-section-header\"><span class=\"intro-section-kicker\">工作流</span><h2>从空白到投递，三步完成</h2><p>不需要从头学怎么写简历，ResumeLM 把每一步都拆好了。</p></div><div class=\"intro-steps\"><div class=\"intro-step\"><span class=\"intro-step-number\">1</span><h3>导入或从模板开始</h3><p>上传已有的 Word/PDF 简历，系统自动解析成可编辑字段。也可以从 6 套模板中任选一套快速起步。</p></div><div class=\"intro-step\"><span class=\"intro-step-number\">2</span><h3>AI 逐模块优化</h3><p>每个模块都能独立诊断和润色。AI 会给出 3 个候选版本，你选择最合适的采纳。只优化表达，不改事实。</p></div><div class=\"intro-step\"><span class=\"intro-step-number\">3</span><h3>评分后导出 PDF</h3><p>系统基于 ATS 兼容性、内容完整度、JD 关键词匹配等 6 个维度打分，确认无误后一键导出。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"intro-section reveal-on-scroll\"><div class=\"intro-section-header\"><span class=\"intro-section-kicker\">AI 能力</span><h2>不只是生成，是完整的简历诊断系统</h2><p>每个建议都基于你的真实经历和岗位 JD，不编造、不虚构。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-grid\"><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></span><h3>整份简历生成</h3><p>基于基础信息生成结构完整的校招简历初稿，直接进入编辑状态微调。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></span><h3>逐模块润色</h3><p>每个模块独立调用 AI，生成 3 个不同风格候选版本，采纳后才写回工作台。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3>ATS 关键词匹配</h3><p>对照目标 JD 分析关键词覆盖情况，给出可执行的自然补充建议。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3>模板级诊断</h3><p>针对个人评价、教育、实习等 8 个模块逐一评分，标注严重程度和改进方向。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-template\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"9\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"7\" x=\"16\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span><h3>6 套校招模板</h3><p>从极简 PM 到蓝橙活力，每种风格都支持颜色、字体、图标和布局微调。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></span><h3>PDF 导出</h3><p>模板预览即所得，一键导出 PDF，版式稳定可直接投递。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"intro-section reveal-on-scroll\"><div class=\"intro-section-header\"><span class=\"intro-section-kicker\">评分标准</span><h2>6 大维度，全面评估简历质量</h2><p>每个维度独立打分，帮你精准定位简历薄弱环节。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-grid\"><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></span><h3>ATS 兼容 · 25分</h3><p>检测简历能否被主流ATS系统正确解析，包括联系方式、标准章节标签、无图片干扰等。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></span><h3>内容完整 · 20分</h3><p>评估各模块填写丰富度，教育经历、实习项目、技能奖项是否充分覆盖。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3>关键词匹配 · 30分</h3><p>对照目标JD提取关键词，检测简历中是否出现对应术语，支持同义词模糊匹配。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></span><h3>成果量化 · 10分</h3><p>统计简历中具体数字、百分比、增长率等量化指标，区分强量化和弱量化表达。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3>评价表达 · 10分</h3><p>分析个人评价是否包含背景、能力、目标等关键信号，个人优势是否具体而非泛泛。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><h3>可读性 · 5分</h3><p>检查段落长度、行文节奏，避免超长段落降低HR阅读效率。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"intro-section reveal-on-scroll\"><div class=\"intro-section-header\"><span class=\"intro-section-kicker\">AI 诊断与优化</span><h2>不只是润色，更是逐模块精准诊断</h2><p>AI 会逐一检查每个模块与 JD 的匹配度，告诉你哪里缺关键词、哪里表达不够好。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-grid\"><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3>模块级诊断</h3><p>针对 8 大模块逐一分析，用红/黄/绿标注匹配度，诊断结果显示在对应模块标题下方，一目了然。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></span><h3>逐模块 AI 润色</h3><p>每个模块独立调用 AI 生成 3 个候选版本，你选择最合适的采纳。只优化表达，不编造事实。</p></div><div class=\"intro-ai-card\"><span class=\"intro-ai-card-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3>JD 关键词补充</h3><p>AI 从 JD 中提取技能关键词供你勾选，加入简历可提升 ATS 机器筛选通过率。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"intro-section reveal-on-scroll intro-cta\"><h2>开始制作你的第一份简历</h2><p>无需登录，免费使用全部功能。</p><div class=\"intro-cta-actions\"><label style=\"position:relative;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-height:50px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;background:#101114;color:#fff;border:0;opacity:1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-up\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 12v6\"></path><path d=\"m15 15-3-3-3 3\"></path></svg>导入已有简历<input accept=\".pdf,.doc,.docx,application/pdf,application/msword,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\" type=\"file\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:0;cursor:pointer\"/></label>          <button type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-template\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"9\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"7\" x=\"16\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg>从模板新建</button></div></section><footer class=\"intro-section reveal-on-scroll intro-footer\"><div class=\"intro-footer-grid\"><div class=\"intro-footer-brand\"><strong>ResumeLM</strong><p>AI 智能简历生成与优化平台</p></div><div class=\"intro-footer-col\"><h4>产品</h4><span>模板库</span><span>ATS 评分</span><span>AI 润色</span></div><div class=\"intro-footer-col\"><h4>联系我们</h4><div class=\"intro-footer-contact\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><span>hi@resumelm.com</span></div><p class=\"intro-footer-contact-note\">遇到问题或有任何建议，欢迎随时邮件联系，我们会在 24 小时内回复。</p></div></div><div class=\"intro-footer-bottom\"><span>ResumeLM 第一期 · 匿名开放 · 数据本地保存</span><span>问卷星团队出品</span></div></footer></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0ht900cau6_ur.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><